      "standardized_narrative": "The syndicate reported a gross prior year reserve strengthening of GBP 166.464 million, representing 7.69% of its opening gross claims outstanding. This was primarily driven by reserve deteriorations on prior year losses, including increased provisions for potential exposures arising from the Russian invasion of Ukraine, particularly impacting the Aviation, Marine & Energy, and Special Risks divisions. This adverse development was partially offset by favourable reserve releases on prior year catastrophe losses, notably from Hurricanes Otis, Ian, and Idalia, and benign attritional claims experience across the Property & Motor and Liability divisions for the 2022 year of account.",
