      "standardized_narrative": "The syndicate recorded gross prior-year strengthening of GBP 166.464m in 2024 (an increase in gross claims outstanding compared to the opening position), representing a 7.69% adverse movement versus opening gross reserves. This deterioration was driven by adverse prior-year development and increases in provisions related to geopolitical exposures (notably arising from the Russian invasion of Ukraine) within the Aviation and Marine & Energy portfolios, together with catastrophe and large-loss developments (e.g. Hurricanes Helene and Milton). Offsetting factors in some divisions included favourable prior-year reserve releases relating to prior catastrophe losses (eg Hurricanes Otis, Ian and Idalia) primarily in Property & Motor.",
